Calculation:

(frac{5)/(6)div(5)/(2) times 3-1 { of } 2}{1+3div(1)/(3) times 6-2}

⇒ {{5 over 6} div {5 over 2} times 3 - 2} over {1 + 9 times 6 - 2}

⇒ {{5 over 6} times {2 over 5} times 3 - 2} over {1 + 9 times 6 - 2}

⇒ {1 - 2} over {1 + 54 - 2}

⇒ {-1} over {53}

⇒ -(1)/(53)

∴ The required answer is -(1)/(53).
